  "description": "The ‘Ring of the Recorder’, which contains the records of sinners, has been stolen!?  The angel Eugene heads to ‘White Demon’, a pub in the human world where the culprit lives, in search of the ring. There, he meets the demon Ruth and strikes a deal with him: if Ruth grants him three wishes, he will return the ring.\n\n*“Don’t you really remember me?”*\n\nRuth’s sad expression and his cryptic words leave him feeling uneasy...\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000053588), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13414745), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/white_devil), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/white_devil)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://honto.jp/ebook/pd-series_C-MBJ-21782-6-609706X.html)",
